<title>USA: Weather offsets Texas Utilities Q1 sales.</title>
<headline>Weather offsets Texas Utilities Q1 sales.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS, Texas 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Texas Utilities Co said Friday moderate weather offset its core sales growth during the first quarter.</p>
<p>The company reported earnings of $0.51 a share on operating revenues of $1.49 billion for the period against $0.56 on $1.46 billion a year ago, when there was colder than normal weather, it said.</p>
<p>Texas Utilities is a holding company for electric utility services and other companies.</p>
</text>
